Phonon mirror for Weekly read aloud
===================================

This folder mirrors, for non-commercial use by the free personal app Weekly,
the Phonon text-to-speech files below. Nothing was retrained or edited.

phonon/model/ : Phonon 40M multilingual by Gradium
  (model.q8.gguf, tokenizer.json, config.json, default-voice.safetensors)
  Original: https://huggingface.co/gradium/phonon-40m-multilingual
  Copied from: https://huggingface.co/empyrealworks/Phonon-40M-multilingual
    at revision 1191d231388bc97330225a2cece698c074eaa3ca
    (its own notice is kept as NOTICE-upstream)
  Credit: Gradium.
  License: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International
    (CC BY-NC 4.0), full text in LICENSE,
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/
  Changes: model.q8.gguf was split, byte for byte, into 20 MiB parts
    (model.q8.gguf.part0 ... part3) so it can be served from GitHub Pages.
    Joined in order the parts are identical to the original file (SHA-256 in
    files.json). The other files are unmodified.

phonon/voices/ : Phonon voices by Gradium (50 of the catalogue voices)
  Original: https://huggingface.co/gradium/phonon-voices
    at revision 0ee17205f254b5abc43b266c8a0f215565c352f7
  License: Apache License 2.0, full text in voices/LICENSE,
    https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
  Changes: none. Files copied unmodified under their catalogue file names.

No endorsement by Gradium is implied.
